<EnglishPolicyLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="How Heart Compass collects and uses information, manages cookies, and handles privacy requests." path="privacy" updated="5 November 2026">
  <p>Your privacy matters to us. This document explains what information is collected at https://www.heartcompass.co.il, how it is used and protected, and your rights under Israel's Protection of Privacy Law, 5741–1981 (including Amendment 13). Using the website constitutes agreement to this policy.</p>
  <section>
    <h2>Who is responsible for your information?</h2>
    <p>The party responsible for information on this website (the “database owner”) is <strong>Yossi Medalsi – Heart Compass</strong>, an Israeli VAT-exempt sole proprietor (business number 025663642). Yossi Medalsi handles privacy enquiries at <a href="mailto:yossi@heartcompass.co.il">yossi@heartcompass.co.il</a>.</p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>What information is collected?</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Information you provide voluntarily:</strong> your name, phone number, email address, preferred language, and message content when contacting us through WhatsApp, email, a contact form, or the newsletter form.</li>
      <li><strong>Anonymous technical information:</strong> general usage data (such as browser type, pages viewed, and referral source) collected through cookies and analytics tools, without personal identification.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We collect only the minimum information needed for the purposes described here.</p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>How is information used?</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Responding to enquiries and arranging coaching sessions.</li>
      <li>Improving the website's content and services.</li>
      <li>Performance measurement and advertising (analytics and remarketing), subject to your cookie consent.</li>
      <li>Sending professional insights and tools only if you explicitly agree through the newsletter form.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>The website uses cookies (small text files stored in your browser) for essential functionality, usage analysis, and advertising. There are two main categories:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Essential cookies:</strong> required for basic website functions and remembering your preferences.</li>
      <li><strong>Analytics and advertising cookies:</strong> loaded only after you consent through the cookie banner, for measurement and improvement.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>You can manage or withdraw your cookie consent through your browser settings or the website's cookie banner. To make the banner appear again, clear the website's stored browser data. Declining analytics and advertising cookies does not prevent you from browsing the website.</p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>Third-party services</h2>
    <p>The website may use third-party measurement and advertising tools that collect information through cookies under their own privacy policies:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Google Analytics and Google Tag Manager for traffic and usage analysis (<a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Privacy Policy</a>).</li>
      <li>Meta (Facebook) Pixel for conversion measurement and advertising (<a href="https://www.facebook.com/privacy/policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Meta Privacy Policy</a>).</li>
      <li>Other advertising-platform measurement tools, such as TikTok, if enabled.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>Sharing information</h2>
    <p>We do not sell or rent personal information. Information may be stored with service providers (website hosting, analytics, and email services) operating in accordance with the law, and will be disclosed only where legally required.</p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>Retention</h2>
    <p>Information is retained for as long as necessary for the purposes for which it was collected, or as required by law, and is then deleted or anonymised. You may request earlier deletion at any time.</p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>Confidentiality of coaching</h2>
    <p>Information shared during coaching conversations and sessions is kept confidential and will not be disclosed to a third party without your consent, except where legally required.</p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>Minors</h2>
    <p>Some coaching services are intended for teens. Coaching a minor takes place with the knowledge and consent of a parent or legal guardian. We do not knowingly collect personal information from anyone under 18 without parental consent. If you become aware that a minor has provided information without consent, please contact us so we can delete it.</p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>Under applicable law, you may request access to, correction of, or deletion of information held about you, and withdraw consent (including unsubscribing from the newsletter) at any time. Contact <a href="mailto:yossi@heartcompass.co.il">yossi@heartcompass.co.il</a>.</p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>For privacy questions, contact Yossi Medalsi at <a href="mailto:yossi@heartcompass.co.il">yossi@heartcompass.co.il</a>.</p>
  </section>
</EnglishPolicyLayout>
